hint Two corals, and nothing dies. Where they grew into each other the shape is denser.
tip Each origin is still alive at the heart of its own coral, six cells apart on one row.
intro Two corals grew into each other around a pair of rocks. Nothing here has ever died.
outro Their hearts still beat, six cells apart.
